{'symbol': 'CAG', 'date': '2022-09-29 08:00:00', 'title': 'CONAGRA BRANDS BRINGS IMPRESSIVE PORTFOLIO OF SNACKS TO 2022 NACS EXPO', 'text': "LEADING BRANDS READY TO SHOWCASE UPCOMING INNOVATION AND TOP SELLERS CHICAGO , SEPT. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CONAGRA BRANDS, INC. (NYSE: CAG), ONE OF NORTH AMERICA'S LEADING BRANDED FOOD COMPANIES, RETURNS TO THE NATIONAL ASSOCIATION OF CONVENIENCE STORES (NACS) EXPO WITH A DYNAMIC COLLECTION OF SNACKS FROM SEVERAL ICONIC AND EMERGING BRANDS."}